    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 6,000 to all enemies in a straight line before you.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Reduces target's HP recovered by healing actions by 25%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>10s\nDamage dealt is not affected by increased or decreased damage effects applied by players.\nCan only be executed while the <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Adrenaline Gauge</span> is full."
