    "Description": "Increases damage dealt by a party member or self by 6% if target is melee DPS or tank, or 3% for all other roles.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 15s\n<If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),33))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),50))><span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect: </span>Grants a <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Solar Sign</span> when used in combat\n<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>Only one arcanum effect can be applied to a target at a time.\n\n※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
  },
